  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Apprentice Notes Summer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Apprentice Notes
  content: 'Things Nolan Told Me Today


    Listen before touching anything.

    Every
    strange sound means something.

    Tighten bolts evenly.

    Don''t rush repairs.

    Ask
    questions before pretending you know the answer.


    Tessa says the last one
    is the most important.

    She''s probably right.'
